    <briefdescription>
<para>Coordination/lookup subsystem for per-character runtime actors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This subsystem is orchestration only:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>discovers and registers runtime actors in the current world</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>resolves character tag to runtime/pawn/controller</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>executes authority-validated character swap flows Replicated authoritative state remains on <ref refid="classAARCharacterStateRuntime" kindref="compound">AARCharacterStateRuntime</ref>. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
